{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o050d","title":"葬怀甄后","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o050d-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"葬怀甄后","evidence":["shaodi-e-o050d-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":251,"label":"乙未","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y251","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o048","basis":"乙未"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o050d-q","shaodi-q-o048","shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o050d-q","source_order":[4,209,"O050d"],"order":1079}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o050d-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4282b30c066f0850a738","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，壬戌〖10〗，皇后甄氏崩。辛未〖11〗，以司空司马孚为太尉。〔八月〕，戊寅〖12〗，太傅司马宣王薨，以卫将军司马景王为抚军大将军〖13〗，录尚书事。乙未〖14〗，葬怀甄后于太清陵〖15〗。庚子〖16〗，骠骑将军孙资薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：嘉平三年（公元 251）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-563b7a630850bbcc0541","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o048","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end